    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Знаешь, что главное?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you know what is the main thing?' The question word for 'what' comes right at the start, followed directly by 'important'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Что?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What?' Notice the word order: 'what' comes first, and 'what' finishes the sentence. And Max jumps in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Главное — ценить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The main thing is to cherish.' Notice the word order: 'important' comes first, and 'to appreciate' finishes the sentence.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ценить что?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cherish what?' You'll hear 'to appreciate' all the time in the show, here connected with 'what'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "То, что у нас есть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What we have.' In Russian, 'what' leads into 'there is' in a very natural everyday phrasing. Vika answers straight away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Где?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where?' Vika starts with 'where' and pairs it with 'where' to make the point clear.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Здесь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here.' In Russian, 'here' leads into 'here' in a very natural everyday phrasing.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "И когда?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And when?' Vika starts with 'when' and pairs it with 'when' to make the point clear. Then Max replies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "И сейчас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And now.' The first content word means 'now', and 'now' rounds out the thought.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Здесь и сейчас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here and now.' A compact expression built around 'here' and 'now'.",
